From: Arch Linux Contributors
Subject: Build the release version without a development suffix

The tagged release commit sets kgb.VERSION to the final release, but the
repository-wide egg_info default still appends .dev0.  Upstream removes that
suffix through its legacy `setup.py release` alias, which is not available to a
PEP 517 frontend.  Clear the suffix for this release build.

diff --git a/setup.cfg b/setup.cfg
index 519274a..16656af 100644
--- a/setup.cfg
+++ b/setup.cfg
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ universal = 1
 
 [egg_info]
-tag_build = .dev
+tag_build =
 
 [flake8]
 ignore = E121,E125,E129,E241,W504
